   "plain_sha1": "4c88c3a05907ef7a11c4eabdb4742ac377eef248",
   "ja": "「雷撃の大嵐」は、対象に最大3スタックまでしか与えられない。",
   "status": "ai_translated_unreviewed",
   "translated_at": "2026-11-02"
  },
  "Template:Data Kennen/Thundering Shuriken#description": {
